notes.body:
@LarsVoelker - could you please check the change to packet-ptp.c ?  The cppcheck warning was:

"Comparison of modulo result is predetermined, because it is always less than 1. [moduleAlwaysTrueFalse]

if (frame_info->pdelay.mean.propagation_delay_unscaled.secs % 1 == 1)

I changed it to modulo 2, and also added parenthesis.

